The radius is 15 m.
\begin{aligned}V&=\frac{4}{3}\pi r^3\\&=\frac{4}{3}\times\pi\times15^3\\&=4500\pi\text{ m}^3\end{aligned}

Solution
\begin{aligned}V&=\frac{4}{3}\pi r^3\\2800&=\frac{4}{3}\pi r^3\\\text{so}\quad r^3&=\frac{2800\times3}{4\pi}\\r&=\sqrt[3]{\frac{2800\times3}{4\pi}}\\&\approx8.7\text{ cm}\quad\text{(Correct to one decimal place.)}\end{aligned}
The radius is approximately 87 mm.
